  "why": "S-12 (accepted): the schema forbids rule chains deeper than 8, matching the oracle, which raises RecursionError beyond depth 8. x9 is nine derivation steps above the base attribute x0.",
  "source": "S-12 decision (accepted 2026-10-04)",
